@startuml
title SC-011 · 配置共享呼入号码、IVR 分流和租户人工路由
skinparam backgroundColor transparent
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam ArrowColor #55657D
skinparam ArrowFontColor #344054
skinparam ArrowFontSize 11
skinparam activity {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #8291A8
  FontColor #25324A
  DiamondBackgroundColor #FFF8E8
  DiamondBorderColor #D19724
  DiamondFontColor #754B00
  BackgroundColor<<event>> #F4EDFF
  BorderColor<<event>> #8A5AC2
  FontColor<<event>> #5D348D
  BackgroundColor<<start_label>> #EEF2FF
  BorderColor<<start_label>> #315EFB
  BackgroundColor<<end_label>> #F2F4F7
  BorderColor<<end_label>> #667085
  BackgroundColor<<failure>> #FFF0F3
  BorderColor<<failure>> #C9364F
  FontColor<<failure>> #8F1930
}
skinparam swimlaneBorderColor #BAC5D5
skinparam swimlaneTitleBackgroundColor #E9EDF3
skinparam swimlaneTitleFontColor #344054
skinparam swimlaneTitleFontSize 13
!pragma useVerticalIf on
|#EDF4FF|lane_1| 超级管理员/租户管理员
|#EFFAF5|lane_2| 统一外呼中台
|#FFF8E8|lane_3| AliCti
|lane_1|
start
:供应商账号需要开通共享号码呼入，或调整 IVR 分支与租户路由; <<start_label>>
|lane_1|
:选择共享呼入号码与已发布入口IVR\n输入：供应商账号号码、分支、默认租户\n输出：呼入路由草稿;
|lane_1|
:配置本租户承接、服务时间及超时兜底\n输入：本租户技能组、营业时间、提示音\n输出：租户呼入规则;
|lane_2|
if (各分支租户均获用号权且组归属正确？) then (不满足 · ALT-011-3)
|lane_1|
:列出无权/失效分支并拒绝发布，保留原有效路由; <<failure>>
stop
else (满足)
|lane_3|
:按文档导入IVR定义文件\n发布与号码入口绑定待确认，导入不代表生效;
|lane_2|
if (发布、号码入口与租户分支映射均已验证？) then (不满足 · ALT-011-5)
|lane_1|
:保持待核对；不得仅存本地分支就宣称厂商已生效; <<failure>>
stop
else (满足)
|lane_2|
:保存路由映射、版本和兜底\n输入：有效路由结果\n输出：呼入先锁定唯一租户再分配坐席;
|lane_1|
:本次操作结束：结果已展示并可追溯; <<end_label>>
stop
endif
endif
@enduml
